{"steam_appid":2660460,"steam_name":"Aviassembly","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2660460/745637/0cae7f05e017410c343a6c3f5ef2aaad7ba60b3e/1750818112/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1724586660","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257049267/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1724586660","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/ss_1f9c9d4f16b1887ecfb5da692296dc6bdcc08c70.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772814667","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/a46b501cfbe981f08a86b2779c838b7614310e04/ss_a46b501cfbe981f08a86b2779c838b7614310e04.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772814667","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/ss_6bcfddd1f4b070a28b53a883e85f2bc66bf8ce40.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772814667","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/ce8b6b9b298a91316daa73bac077a66cc5a46747/ss_ce8b6b9b298a91316daa73bac077a66cc5a46747.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772814667","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/ss_0f6e2462a42307c3af4a22fe029a8486ca0d6023.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772814667"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build A Plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own plane</strong>. Balance fuel capacity, weight, speed, cargo space and more. Choose parts carefully to optimize your plane for the desired flight characteristics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/752dfe057f7b0fd4d37d216c5a90e6b0.poster.avif?t=1772814667\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/752dfe057f7b0fd4d37d216c5a90e6b0.webm?t=1772814667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/752dfe057f7b0fd4d37d216c5a90e6b0.mp4?t=1772814667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your plane, complete missions, and earn money.</strong> You'll need to haul different cargo types, each with unique requirements, so plan your trips carefully and avoid running out of fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/8943231edb1e1bd52519df02cf0b69b3.poster.avif?t=1772814667\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/8943231edb1e1bd52519df02cf0b69b3.webm?t=1772814667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/8943231edb1e1bd52519df02cf0b69b3.mp4?t=1772814667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Research and Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research new parts</strong> and improve your designs to fly farther, faster, and carry more cargo. Upgrade your plane to handle bigger missions and explore new areas.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/a62d4f59bdf17eb92a63a2f4183ddb1c.poster.avif?t=1772814667\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/a62d4f59bdf17eb92a63a2f4183ddb1c.webm?t=1772814667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/a62d4f59bdf17eb92a63a2f4183ddb1c.mp4?t=1772814667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an open world</strong> and find new airports and islands, each offering new challenges to test your plane designs and piloting skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/748060d4204bdd5c514ec3057a341256.poster.avif?t=1772814667\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/748060d4204bdd5c514ec3057a341256.webm?t=1772814667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660460/extras/748060d4204bdd5c514ec3057a341256.mp4?t=1772814667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build your own airplane and optimize its performance. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Takeoff, fly and land your plane with physics based controls. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore and discover new biomes, each offering unique challenges and cargo types. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Transport and sell different cargo types. Each cargo type offers its own unique challenge. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get creative in creative mode. Use your infinite resources to build anything you can imagine. </p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I5 4460 3.20 Ghz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Jelle Booij"],"publishers":["Jelle Booij"],"release_date":"11 Apr, 2025"}